    "detailed_description": "<h1>WRONGED IS NOW AVAILABLE IN VR</h1><p>WRONGED is now available to play in VR.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>WRONGED is a game about escaping a warped, oppressive nightmare using only household items and your own wits. Featuring a low-poly art style and classic item-based adventure-puzzle gameplay, WRONGED has multiple pathways for multiple endings. VR version included.\r\n\r\nThe Steam edition of WRONGED also includes a download of the Cryptid Jam 2019 game CREEP.",
